# oracle: fix hmc with stochastic Metropolis decisions (T = 1.2, dt 0.012): the random_equal stream of RanPark(seed), accept/reject counters, tail-corrected pe
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 9.9e-10, atoms 7.3e-9 (chaotic growth of rounding over 400 steps of an LJ fluid; all 40 accept/reject decisions as native: 29 accepted).
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             type 1 type/fraction 2 0.3 4321
mass            1 1.0
mass            2 1.7
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
pair_coeff      2 2 0.8 1.1 2.5
pair_modify     tail yes
velocity        all create 1.2 4928459 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all hmc 10 98731 1.2
timestep        0.012
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal press f_2 f_2[1] f_2[2] f_2[3] f_2[4] f_2[5]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             400
